# The origin of an Aivory API server, including http:// or https://.
# The frontend is bundled locally; this URL is used for API requests.
# Optional first-launch default, not the /api endpoint. Example: https://chat.example.com
# Leave empty for a generic package; users enter their server on first launch.
AIVORY_DESKTOP_BASE_URL=

# Choose official or custom update packages in /admin/settings/desktop.
